The Brass would like you to lead the Liberty's forces on a clean-up operation here on Europa. Destroy the CCA Unit Factory, hangar and silos and close down any possible escape hatches or supply lines to their Titan forces. Once you have taken care of your mission here, you will join up with the Justice and the Freedom at Titan.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Defend your Recycler
- Destroy the CCA Unit Factory, hangar and all four silos.
